# DESK21 "before": the View and the Options drop-down as they stand at HEAD
# a8d4b42 -- `Set background...` is the FIRST entry of Options and the View
# menu ends at `Size to fit`.
#   View title hover    (136,9)   from the probe run's menu dump
#   Options title hover (196,9)   from the same dump
# The pointer approaches the bar from straight below its own title so it
# crosses no other title on the way (MEMORY: injector park must not cross the
# menu bar); the View -> Options slide stays inside the bar row.
# Every mark is followed by >= 1000 ticks (5 s) of quiet so the QMP screendump
# cannot race the next step.
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1500 mark A_IDLE
2600 move 136 240
2700 move 136 9
3400 mark B_VIEW
4500 move 196 9
5200 mark C_OPTIONS
6400 pause
